# JudeanFloraV1; canonical UE cm (X east, +Y south, Z up), written with Y reflected and triangle winding reversed for the legacy OBJ importer adapter. One o object, no g groups, so the importer creates exactly one material slot.
# terebinth (Pistacia palaestina / P. atlantica), LOD1 leaf
# height range 4.0-12.0 m, crown 4.0-12.0 m; source: Zohary, M., Plants of the Bible (Cambridge University Press, 1982), species entry Pistacia palaestina (3-8 m) and P. atlantica (10-15 m, very broad crown); the range spans both, which is why it is wide
# part kinds and their winding checks are recorded in vegetation-manifest.json
o SM_JudeanFloraV1_Terebinth_L1_Leaf
